  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Your innate affinity to your benefactor’s energy grows stronger. Your resistance to your selected trait becomes equal to your level. You are capable of weathering most non-extreme cases of climate or conditions that pertain to your Benefactor’s domains or environments that align with their Domains, Aspects &amp; Themes.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Special</span></span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"> If you have the @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.ancestries.EM36aA87rp3QJ31E]{Terrain Gifts} feat, you are considered a Master in Survival for the purpose of that feat. If your proficiency increases to become a Master in Survival, the circumstance bonus it grants increases to +3.</span></p>"
